0f&oh=00_AQTCUSN87Qm4PAZjVZiwuz8B1WKGVBx_LY6AF2m1QiaxRQ&oe=6B0C7F11"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "75203613_1476526155861994_2849741046055698432_n (1).png", "id": "828778024522260", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974917_828778027855593_7321425277857207517_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VanTZ-Vb2fcQ7kNvwGYC85d&_nc_oc=AdpDJ4BsHdnRUAtfV6h57DVKHC8gPY7PFkueQbQvCW_RL8-Vw8Otn6cq3Vp6rsYNzKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTiInA1raeISQw35gexcPQCsdmdyuFeBdD55gTYOgW5Mw&oe=6B0C6F68"}, "display_name": "Museum Multiverse", "keywords": ["adventure", "platforming", "art", "multiverse", "hessvacio"], "long_description": "# Welcome to the Wonderful Wondrous World of Museum Multiverse\n\nMuseum Multiverse is a multidimensional puzzle platformer that chronicles the adventures of a child who has mysteriously awoken in an abandoned museum. To escape, he must journey deeper into its cursed halls and traverse the extraordinary worlds hidden within its art pieces.\n\n# Journey Beyond the Canvas\n{1136025298615521}\n\n\n\nEach painting leads to a strange new realm filled with platforming challenges, mystery, and discovery. As the adventure unfolds, every frame may reveal a new path, a hidden secret, or another piece of the museum\u2019s haunting mystery.\n\n# A Family-Friendly VR Adventure\n{917286157940650}\n\nFrom eerie corridors to surreal worlds beyond the canvas, Museum Multiverse blends atmosphere, story, and exploration into a family-friendly adventure designed to spark curiosity and wonder.\n\n# What Awaits You\n{1455418759286833}\n\n- Immersive VR platforming\n- A mysterious museum setting\n- Worlds hidden inside works of art\n- Family-friendly adventure and exploration\n\n**Step into the museum and discover what lies beyond the canvas.**\n\n{1972131163728335}\n\n", "short_description": "The Webby-Nominated Museum Multiverse is a multidi